{"page":174,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:179","surah":7,"ayah":179,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ ذَرَأْنَا لِجَهَنَّمَ كَثِيرًا مِّنَ ٱلْجِنِّ وَٱلْإِنسِ ۖ لَهُمْ قُلُوبٌ لَّا يَفْقَهُونَ بِهَا وَلَهُمْ أَعْيُنٌ لَّا يُبْصِرُونَ بِهَا وَلَهُمْ ءَاذَانٌ لَّا يَسْمَعُونَ بِهَآ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ كَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ بَلْ هُمْ أَضَلُّ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْغَـٰفِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have created many jinn and people who are destined for Hell, with hearts they do not use for comprehension, eyes they do not use for sight, ears they do not use for hearing. They are like cattle, no, even further astray: these are the ones who are entirely heedless.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ذَرَأْنَا","en_gloss":"We have created","transliteration":"dharanā","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِجَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"for Hell","transliteration":"lijahannama","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَثِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"many","transliteration":"kathīran","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْجِنِّ","en_gloss":"the jinn","transliteration":"l-jini","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلْإِنسِ ۖ","en_gloss":"and men","transliteration":"wal-insi","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"For them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قُلُوبٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) hearts","transliteration":"qulūbun","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(but) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَفْقَهُونَ","en_gloss":"they understand","transliteration":"yafqahūna","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِهَا","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَعْيُنٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) eyes","transliteration":"aʿyunun","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(but) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يُبْصِرُونَ","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"yub'ṣirūna","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِهَا","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ءَاذَانٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) ears","transliteration":"ādhānun","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":20,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(but) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":21,"ar":"يَسْمَعُونَ","en_gloss":"they hear","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":22,"ar":"بِهَآ ۚ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":23,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":24,"ar":"كَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","en_gloss":"(are) like cattle","transliteration":"kal-anʿāmi","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":25,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":26,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":27,"ar":"أَضَلُّ ۚ","en_gloss":"(are) more astray","transliteration":"aḍallu","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":28,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those ","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":29,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ٱلْغَـٰفِلُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the heedless","transliteration":"l-ghāfilūna","verse_key":"7:179"},{"pos":31,"ar":"١٧٩","en_gloss":"(179)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:179"}]},{"verse_key":"7:180","surah":7,"ayah":180,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ ٱلْأَسْمَآءُ ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ فَٱدْعُوهُ بِهَا ۖ وَذَرُوا۟ ٱلَّذِينَ يُلْحِدُونَ فِىٓ أَسْمَـٰٓئِهِۦ ۚ سَيُجْزَوْنَ مَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Most Excellent Names belong to God: use them to call on Him, and keep away from those who abuse them- they will be requited for what they do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"And for Allah","transliteration":"walillahi","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْأَسْمَآءُ","en_gloss":"(are) the names ","transliteration":"l-asmāu","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","en_gloss":"the most beautiful","transliteration":"l-ḥus'nā","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَٱدْعُوهُ","en_gloss":"so invoke Him","transliteration":"fa-id'ʿūhu","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"by them","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَذَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"And leave","transliteration":"wadharū","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُلْحِدُونَ","en_gloss":"deviate","transliteration":"yul'ḥidūna","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"concerning","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَسْمَـٰٓئِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"His names","transliteration":"asmāihi","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَيُجْزَوْنَ","en_gloss":"They will be recompensed","transliteration":"sayuj'zawna","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"do","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"7:180"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٨٠","en_gloss":"(180)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:180"}]},{"verse_key":"7:181","surah":7,"ayah":181,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِمَّنْ خَلَقْنَآ أُمَّةٌ يَهْدُونَ بِٱلْحَقِّ وَبِهِۦ يَعْدِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Among those We created are a group of people who guide with truth and act justly according to it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِمَّنْ","en_gloss":"And of (those) whom","transliteration":"wamimman","verse_key":"7:181"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَلَقْنَآ","en_gloss":"We have created","transliteration":"khalaqnā","verse_key":"7:181"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُمَّةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a nation","transliteration":"ummatun","verse_key":"7:181"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَهْدُونَ","en_gloss":"who guides","transliteration":"yahdūna","verse_key":"7:181"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"with the truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"7:181"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَبِهِۦ","en_gloss":"and thereby","transliteration":"wabihi","verse_key":"7:181"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَعْدِلُونَ","en_gloss":"they establish justice","transliteration":"yaʿdilūna","verse_key":"7:181"},{"pos":8,"ar":"١٨١","en_gloss":"(181)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:181"}]},{"verse_key":"7:182","surah":7,"ayah":182,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا سَنَسْتَدْرِجُهُم مِّنْ حَيْثُ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But We lead on those who reject Our messages, step by step, without them realizing it:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"But those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"7:182"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"denied","transliteration":"kadhabū","verse_key":"7:182"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","en_gloss":"Our Signs","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"7:182"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سَنَسْتَدْرِجُهُم","en_gloss":"We will gradually lead them","transliteration":"sanastadrijuhum","verse_key":"7:182"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:182"},{"pos":6,"ar":"حَيْثُ","en_gloss":"where","transliteration":"ḥaythu","verse_key":"7:182"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:182"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"they know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"7:182"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٨٢","en_gloss":"(182)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:182"}]},{"verse_key":"7:183","surah":7,"ayah":183,"ar_uthmani":"وَأُمْلِى لَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ كَيْدِى مَتِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"I will give them respite, but My plan is sure.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأُمْ